<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is intensifying artillery shelling and demolishing homes in southern Lebanon, targeting Hezbollah positions and civilian structures. Hezbollah faces legal pressure as Lebanese authorities have charged five members with recruiting and arming others, and sanctions have been imposed on a Lebanese charity and gold companies for aiding the group. The World Bank reports that reconstruction in Lebanon is progressing slowly. Iraq has reached a compromise with a powerful pro-Iran militia to prevent a clash, according to officials. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOeUFnTlFvemVwVno0eU5NcHhyM2YyRzRmbTJSQ3N6X1pzV2g2UmhtWmd1WXFqN18wVnZOSi1tRjZieU9hT016cGZkaWtwOGpFZzRCTFVxVjNOc2xnMjlGYndjYW1QdW9mNjJ3eVpTdndwakJ5OG9RQUdYTzhLVTU1RFkzdHZTcnlMN0cxa1lLdVMtb0xMcDg1dzdrQWx5cURGc250SGFEZEFnM2hL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
